<span id="S3.T1.3.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.3.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">C.II</span> Cherrypicking information based on assumed context (19/21)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.3.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S3.T1.3.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.3.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.3.1.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">S.II</span> More sources retrieved than used for generating the actual answer (13/21)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.3.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
