<span id="S3.T1.3.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.3.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">A.III</span> Overtly confident language while presenting claims (16/21)</span>
</span></td>
