<span id="S3.T1.3.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.3.1.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">C.III</span> Missing citations for claims and information generated (18/21)</span>
</span></td>
