<span id="S4.T6.3.1.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Additional work to verify and trust sources <span id="S4.T6.3.1.16.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#5900A7;">[U.II]</span></span>
