</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2. </span>Participant Data Information</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present an anonymized list of participants, in Table <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.2. Participant Data Information ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Search Engines in an AI Era: The False Promise of Factual and Verifiable Source-Cited Responses" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, highlighting the diversity of expertise and the answer engines utilized by each participant throughout the study.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table">
